WorldPulse core content: all rights reserved.

The files under reference/ are the game's own content definitions and pixel art, published so that
mod authors and their tools can read them, validate against them and copy individual defs into a mod
to change them.

You may: read them; use them to build and check mods for WorldPulse; include in a WorldPulse mod the
specific defs your mod overrides, changed or unchanged.

You may not: redistribute this content as a whole or in substantial part outside a WorldPulse mod,
or use it (art included) in other games or products.

These files are regenerated from the game with every toolkit update; do not edit them.
